@startuml 顺序图-UC11-超时未签到自动释放
title 顺序图 · UC-11 超时未签到自动释放
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
autonumber
hide footbox

participant "定时调度器" as Timer
participant "超时未签到释放任务" as Task
participant "预约仓储" as Repo
database "数据库" as DB
participant "违约与信用控制器" as Credit
participant "通知服务\n(Outbox)" as Notify

Timer -> Task: 每 5 分钟触发 run(scanAt, batchSize)
Task -> Repo: findOverdueCandidates(scanAt, cursor, batchSize)
Repo -> DB: 查询 ACTIVE 且\n开始后 10 分钟无有效签到
DB --> Repo: candidates
Repo --> Task: candidates

loop 每条候选预约（单条独立事务）
  Task -> Repo: lockAndLoad(reservationId)
  Repo -> DB: BEGIN + SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
  DB --> Repo: current status
  Repo --> Task: reservation
  alt 已签到 / 已取消 / 状态已变化
    Task -> DB: ROLLBACK
    Task -> Task: skipped++
  else 仍为 ACTIVE 且已超时
    Task -> Repo: markAutoReleased(reservationId, eventKey)
    Repo -> DB: UPDATE status=AUTO_RELEASED\nINSERT violation(event key)\nINSERT notification_outbox
    alt 唯一键表明已处理
      DB --> Repo: no-op
      Task -> Task: skipped++
    else 首次处理
      DB --> Repo: released
      Repo --> Task: released
      Task -> Credit: recalculate(userId)
      Credit -> DB: 重算信用；达阈值则设置 14 天限制
      DB --> Credit: creditUpdated
      Credit --> Task: creditResult
      Task -> Notify: 写入释放、违约、限制通知
      Task -> DB: INSERT task_run_log + COMMIT
      Task -> Task: released++
    end
  end
end

Task --> Timer: runId, processed, released,\nskipped, failed, nextCursor
Note over Task, DB
  单条失败只记录错误，不回滚整批；
  下一轮按游标或幂等键补偿。
  通知由提交后的 Outbox 投递器发送。
end note
@enduml
